After a long hiatus, I got interested in NetHack again, and finally
updated the Geoduck alternate tileset. It's an attempt to combine the
compactness of ACSII with the extra information of tiles. You can get
more info at the address in my sig. (Note that many of the links to
the GTS still go to my old site, which is a rotting zombie no longer
under my control.)

The biggest change this time around is that I've gone from 20x10
pixels to 20x12; newer computer monitors have the room, and it helped
unclutter the screen a bit, leaving those edge pixels blank. If you're
updating to the new version, be sure and change the line in your NH
defaults file to the new name/dimensions!

NOTE: This set is for "vanilla" NetHack ONLY, NOT SporkHack. If the
SporkHack Power(s)-That-Be ever release an official tile-set, I will
see what I can do about making a version of mine. I do have a version
for Slash'EM available at my site, but it has not been updated this
time around.

If you've got any suggestions for improvements, or places I should be
promoting this, drop me a line!
